1
00:03:44,347 --> 00:03:50,347
Fear will drag you deeper.

2
00:07:28,695 --> 00:07:34,695
Quicksand is a thriller, horror, mystery film directed by Andres Beltran.

3
00:11:13,043 --> 00:11:19,043
A married couple on the brink of divorce becomes trapped in
quicksand while hiking through a Colombian rainforest.

4
00:14:57,391 --> 00:15:03,391
It’s a struggle for survival as they battle the elements of the
jungle and must work together in order to escape.

5
00:18:41,739 --> 00:18:47,739
Sofia, played by Carolina Gaitán.

6
00:22:26,086 --> 00:22:32,086
Josh, played by Allan Hawco.

7
00:26:10,434 --> 00:26:16,434
Marcos, played by Sebastián Eslava.

8
00:29:54,782 --> 00:30:00,782
Diego, played by Andrés Castañeda.

9
00:33:39,130 --> 00:33:45,130
Front Desk Clerk, played by Allison Castrillón.

10
00:37:23,478 --> 00:37:29,478
Concierge, played by Juan Manuel Combariza.

11
00:41:07,826 --> 00:41:13,826
Spellbound is a 2024 American animated musical fantasy comedy film directed by Vicky Jenson from a screenplay by Julia Miranda and
the writing team of Lauren Hynek and Elizabeth Martin, based on a story conceived by Jenson, Hynek, and Martin.

12
00:44:52,173 --> 00:44:58,173
It features music composed by Alan Menken, who also wrote the songs
with longtime collaborator and lyricist Glenn Slater.

13
00:48:36,521 --> 00:48:42,521
Produced by Skydance Animation, the film features the voices of Rachel Zegler, John Lithgow,
Jenifer Lewis, Tituss Burgess, Nathan Lane, Javier Bardem, and Nicole Kidman.

14
00:52:20,869 --> 00:52:26,869
Set in the world of magic known as Lumbria, the story follows Princess Ellian (Zegler) who must break the
spell that has turned her parents (Bardem and Kidman) into monsters and split her kingdom in two.

15
00:56:05,217 --> 00:56:11,217
The project, initially titled Split, was announced in July 2017, shortly after Skydance Animation
was formed in March 2017, with Paramount Pictures scheduling distribution for 2019.

16
00:59:49,565 --> 00:59:55,565
The film subsequently underwent changes, such as release dates, with Jenson later announced as the director, and
the film's title changed to The Unbreakable Spell, before eventually getting to its current title.

17
01:03:33,913 --> 01:03:39,913
The film was acquired by Apple TV+ in December 2020, before
Netflix took over the rights in October 2023.

18
01:07:18,260 --> 01:07:24,260
Much of the main voice cast signed on in June 2022,
following Zegler's casting in April 2022.

19
01:11:02,608 --> 01:11:08,608
Production was done remotely during the COVID-19 pandemic.

20
01:14:46,956 --> 01:14:52,956
Spellbound premiered at the Paris Theater in New York City on November
11, 2024, and was released via Netflix on November 22.

21
01:18:31,304 --> 01:18:37,304
It received mixed reviews from critics.

22
01:22:15,652 --> 01:22:21,652
The tone is mind_bending and dark and emotional.
